tyle="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">July 5,<br>2025</font></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">Revenues</font></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">$</font></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">228,189&#160;</font></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">$</font></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">192,845&#160;</font></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">$</font></td><td style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-s